&lt;br /&gt;
&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;AFTERWORD:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt; When SCP-5914 walks out of the observation chamber, the researchers asked why it brought SCP-682 back to life. SCP-5914 responded that SCP-682 was one of its favorite SCPs in the Foundation, although it&#039;s true that SCP-682 is evil, however, its very cool to SCP-5914, so successfully terminating it would cause SCP-5914 to feel very dull.&lt;br /&gt;
&lt;br /&gt;
&lt;br /&gt;
&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;RESULTS:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt; &lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: line-through;&quot;&gt;The termination of SCP-682 was a success as 100% of its body was destroyed, leaving no trace&lt;/span&gt; The termination of SCP-682 wasn&#039;t a success as after it was a success, SCP-5914 has brought it back to life.&lt;/p&gt;
