&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:150%;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;FILE-06&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br /&gt;
&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;DATE:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt; 01/13/2013&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: center;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:150%;&quot;&gt;&lt;tt&gt;EXPERIMENT 6 &amp;#8212; INTELLIGENCE LEVEL TESTING-01&lt;/tt&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;FOREWORD:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt; On 01/13/2014, SCP-5914 was asked to test its intelligence level upon doing an examination test that the Foundation has made for it. SCP-5914 has 10 minutes to read through the given documents and later on has 30 minutes written down answers without using any of its anomalous abilities.&lt;br /&gt;
&lt;br /&gt;
&lt;br /&gt;
&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;NAME:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt; Researcher Rainwards with researcher Taylor.&lt;br /&gt;
&lt;br /&gt;
&lt;br /&gt;
&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;PROCEDURES:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt; SCP-5914 leaks through the documents for only 3 minutes before proceeding to the examination test immediately due to it wanting to bring SCP-053 to meet SCP-999, it writes down all the answers. It finishes the test for only 15 minutes without re-checking to see if there are any errors. Later on, after another 15 minutes have passed, the Foundation&#039;s researchers checked on the exam and saw that it has no errors.&lt;br /&gt;
&lt;br /&gt;
&lt;br /&gt;
&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;AFTERWORD:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt; SCP-5914 walks out of the observation chamber after swearing for a few times as it has taken SCP-053 to SCP-999 in the aftermath.&lt;br /&gt;
&lt;br /&gt;
&lt;br /&gt;
&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;RESULTS:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt; SCP-5914 could score a direct 100/100 with no much effort. It looks like the subject has a great photographic memory.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;note&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:150%;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;FILE-07&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br /&gt;
&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;DATE:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt; 01/20/2013&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: center;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:150%;&quot;&gt;&lt;tt&gt;EXPERIMENT 7 &amp;#8212; INTELLIGENCE LEVEL TESTING-02&lt;/tt&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;FOREWORD:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt; On 01/20/2014, SCP-5914 was asked to demonstrate its knowledge in knowing what are the containment procedures of SCP-096 and SCP-2371 without taking a peek through.&lt;br /&gt;
&lt;br /&gt;
&lt;br /&gt;
&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;NAME:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt; Researcher Rainwards with researcher Taylor.&lt;br /&gt;
&lt;br /&gt;
&lt;br /&gt;
&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;PROCEDURES:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt; SCP-5914 responded that the containment procedures of SCP-096 are to be kept in a 5&amp;#160;m x 5&amp;#160;m x 5&amp;#160;m airtight steel cube at all times. Weekly checks for any cracks or holes are mandatory. There are to be absolutely no video surveillance or visual tools of any kind inside SCP-096&#039;s cell. Security personnel will use pre-installed pressure sensors and laser detectors to ensure SCP-096&#039;s presence inside the cell. SCP-2317 is to be secured at Containment Area-179 in a reinforced 3m x 3m x 3m containment chamber. Armed guards are to be in place at all times to prevent unauthorized access to the facility.&lt;br /&gt;
&lt;br /&gt;
&lt;br /&gt;
&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;AFTERWORD:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt; Researchers have asked how calm SCP-5914 was able to know. SCP-5914 responded that it had sawed the description of the containment procedures thousands of times, and it felt extremely bored after having to sit and let the gathered individuals inside of SCP-5914-01 watch it. SCP-5914 soon walks out of the observation chamber as it stops by the containment chamber of SCP-5031 to taste its food along with SCP-053 and SCP-999, giving it some cooking books, and shows its more cooking lessons on the widescreen.&lt;br /&gt;
&lt;br /&gt;
&lt;br /&gt;
&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;RESULTS:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt; SCP-5914 explained the containment procedures of SCP-096 and SCP-2317 with no wrong information.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;note&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:150%;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;FILE-08&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br /&gt;
&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;DATE:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt; 01/25/2014&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: center;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:150%;&quot;&gt;&lt;tt&gt;EXPERIMENT 8 &amp;#8212; ANOMALOUS ABILITIES-05&lt;/tt&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;FOREWORD:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt; On 01/25/2014, SCP-5914 was asked to see whether it can transport the researchers to the &amp;quot;The Barrelplex&amp;quot;. However, SCP-5914 immediately shouts out that it doesn&#039;t want to, for the peoples there fear it.&lt;br /&gt;
&lt;br /&gt;
&lt;br /&gt;
&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;NAME:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt; Researcher Rainwards with researcher Taylor.&lt;br /&gt;
&lt;br /&gt;
&lt;br /&gt;
&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;PROCEDURES:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt; The researchers did not argue and asked for another request. If it can transport a group of Class-D subjects to a parallel universe, SCP-5914, without hesitation, transports the Class-D subjects into another reality while sitting on a levitating bean bag. After about five days have passed, SCP-5914 was once again called to the observation chamber, where it was instructed to transport the Class-D crew back to the observation chamber. SCP-5914 said that there is only one alive D-Class subject left. The rest have died. The subject also explains how did they die. However, later on, transported the last D-Class subject back, the D-Class, subject D-458103 was crawling in fear, researchers have asked what did the subject saw, the subject exclaimed that what they say are the things that no one must ever saw, it is unknown whether what reality did SCP-5914 transport them into.&lt;br /&gt;
&lt;br /&gt;
&lt;br /&gt;
&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;AFTERWORD:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt; SCP-5914 walks out of the observation chamber; the researchers have asked SCP-5914 why did it begin to volunteer in experiments like this. SCP-5914 revealed that it has powerful precognition in seeing what will happen next. It also exclaimed that the Foundation would only do nine experiments on it, tomorrow is the last one, so it won&#039;t hesitate but to volunteer in the last two ones. It then exited the observation chamber, went back to its containment cell, and watched one of its favorite universes.&lt;br /&gt;
&lt;br /&gt;
&lt;br /&gt;
&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;RESULTS:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt; It is unknown what reality the Class-D subjects saw. They did not provide any information about that place other than this &amp;quot;The End of the World.&amp;quot; It also reveals a new piece of information that SCP-5914 has a powerful vision of knowing what&#039;ll happen next. However, SCP-5914 seems to have revealed something else. It claimed that the beings that existed in the &amp;quot;Barrelplex&amp;quot; feared it. This is getting weird, firstly. In the interview with researcher Rainwards, SCP-5914 claims that it was seen as mistaken and was banished. However, now it said that beings there feared it, what does this suppose to mean?&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;note&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:150%;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;FILE-09&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br /&gt;
&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;DATE:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt; 02/04/2014&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: center;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:150%;&quot;&gt;&lt;tt&gt;EXPERIMENT 9 &amp;#8212; ANOMALOUS ABILITIES-06&lt;/tt&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;FOREWORD:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt; On 02/04/2014, it was also the final experiment that&#039;ll be launch on SCP-5914 as that was what it had claimed yesterday. SCP-5914 was asked to see whether if it can resurrect one of the neutralized SCPs.&lt;br /&gt;
&lt;br /&gt;
&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;PROCEDURES:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt; SCP-5914 did not hesitate but immediately raises its hands and forms a plain cardboard box that is 32&amp;#160;cm x 20&amp;#160;cm x 26&amp;#160;cm. It is spray-painted silver on the interior and exterior, and the words &amp;quot;HERE BE DRAGONS&amp;quot; are handwritten in black permanent marker on the lid of the container. It was SCP-1762, and all of its instances were also fully restored with no errors along the way. However, the box disappears all of a sudden.&lt;br /&gt;
&lt;br /&gt;
&lt;br /&gt;
&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;NAME:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt; Researcher Rainwards with researcher Taylor.&lt;br /&gt;
&lt;br /&gt;
&lt;br /&gt;
&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;AFTERWORD:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt; SCP-5914 walks out of the observation chamber; the researchers were about to asked SCP-XXXX why the box disappears. SCP-5914 responded, &amp;quot;Isn&#039;t it obvious fuckers, have you ever heard, what comes up, must come down? That&#039;s the rules of death and life&amp;quot; it then exits the observation room.&lt;br /&gt;
&lt;br /&gt;
&lt;br /&gt;
&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;RESULTS:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt; It would appear like SCP-5914 can resurrect neutralized SCPs without much effort. As it also &amp;quot;understands&amp;quot; the rules between life and death.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:150%;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;FILE-010&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br /&gt;
&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;DATE:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt; 02/05/2014&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: center;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:150%;&quot;&gt;&lt;tt&gt;DOCUMENT 10 &amp;#8212; THE &amp;quot;BARRELPLEX&amp;quot;&lt;/tt&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;br /&gt;
&lt;tt&gt;&amp;gt; ERROR OCCUR&amp;#8230;&lt;/tt&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;tt&gt;&amp;gt; UNABLE TO ACCESS FILE.&lt;/tt&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;tt&gt;&amp;gt; FILE DELETED BY @#@#*$$&lt;/tt&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;tt&gt;&amp;gt; VIRUS DETECTED&amp;#8230;&lt;/tt&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;tt&gt;&amp;gt; RESTARTING CLIENT&amp;#8230;&lt;/tt&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;tt&gt;&amp;gt; LOGGING OFF IN 3 SECONDS&amp;#8230;&lt;/tt&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;tt&gt;&amp;gt; LOG OUT SUCCESS.&lt;/tt&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;tt&gt;&amp;gt; SHUTTING DOWN IN 5 SECONDS&amp;#8230;&lt;/tt&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;tt&gt;&amp;gt; SHUTTING DOWN&amp;#8230;&lt;/tt&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;footnotes-footer&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;Footnotes&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;footnote-footer&quot; id=&quot;footnote-812103-1&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;javascript:;&quot;  &gt;1&lt;/a&gt;. Currently, the entity is exceptionally stubborn and not obeying the Foundation&#039;s instructions/commands. The anomaly has kept on breaching the containment chamber while causing out containment breaches most of the time for its enjoyments, so it&#039;s not yet contained. Instead, it sees the Foundation as a place to explore freely and do whatever it wants to.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;footnote-footer&quot; id=&quot;footnote-812103-2&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;javascript:;&quot;  &gt;2&lt;/a&gt;. However. Now, it has no intention of doing so&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;footnote-footer&quot; id=&quot;footnote-812103-3&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;javascript:;&quot;  &gt;3&lt;/a&gt;. It means no proper physical form. Though they may have physical avatars or bodies, their true essence exists non-physically, whether as a soul, as energy, or as an abstract concept. However, in SCP-5914 cases, it is considered differently. The entity can shapeshift or sometimes manifest its non-physical avatar and turns it into a physical avatar.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;footnote-footer&quot; id=&quot;footnote-812103-4&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;javascript:;&quot;  &gt;4&lt;/a&gt;. The forms it has manifested into/taken can either be from an individual that it has once encounter or an individual that does not exist. However, the entity took men/boys&#039; appearance while doing its &amp;quot;job,&amp;quot; presuming that it is a male.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;footnote-footer&quot; id=&quot;footnote-812103-5&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;javascript:;&quot;  &gt;5&lt;/a&gt;. This is not its proper form.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;footnote-footer&quot; id=&quot;footnote-812103-6&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;javascript:;&quot;  &gt;6&lt;/a&gt;. Currently, it is unknown whether what does the &amp;quot;Barrelplex&amp;quot; looks like.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;footnote-footer&quot; id=&quot;footnote-812103-7&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;javascript:;&quot;  &gt;7&lt;/a&gt;. In-short, it has absolute control over everything irrespective of whether if it&#039;s space and time, reality, laws of physics, nature, and events. The anomaly would also be able to control everything even when it is outside of SCP-5914-01. SCP-5914-01 is just a place to hide the gathered individuals to let them spectate in other universes to avoid getting caught, disrupting, or getting disrupted by the individuals seen on the widescreen.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;footnote-footer&quot; id=&quot;footnote-812103-8&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;javascript:;&quot;  &gt;8&lt;/a&gt;. In short parallel universes.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;footnote-footer&quot; id=&quot;footnote-812103-9&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;javascript:;&quot;  &gt;9&lt;/a&gt;. However, it depends on the entity&#039;s decision; it would sometimes let the gathered individuals figure it out themselves.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;footnote-footer&quot; id=&quot;footnote-812103-10&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;javascript:;&quot;  &gt;10&lt;/a&gt;. While being distracted by another, spacing out for a moment, thinking/imagining other things&amp;#8230;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;footnote-footer&quot; id=&quot;footnote-812103-11&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;javascript:;&quot;  &gt;11&lt;/a&gt;. Which are its free time/day off of work&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;footnote-footer&quot; id=&quot;footnote-812103-12&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;javascript:;&quot;  &gt;12&lt;/a&gt;. Even if it is forbidden to, it would just go out of its containment cell anytime it wants without the Foundation&#039;s permission. It also means the entity is sometimes very stubborn and would be considered as a scapegoat.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;footnote-footer&quot; id=&quot;footnote-812103-13&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;javascript:;&quot;  &gt;13&lt;/a&gt;. Sometimes from the universe that it is currently living in, which the Foundation always has to keep a very close look upon the gathered individuals to, later on, wipe out their memories after SCP-5914 finishes its job.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;by &lt;span class=&quot;printuser avatarhover&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/godlyuser&quot;  &gt;&lt;img class=&quot;small&quot; src=&quot;http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=6876114&amp;amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;amp;timestamp=1607979345&quot; alt=&quot;GodlyUser&quot; style=&quot;background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=6876114)&quot; /&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/godlyuser&quot;  &gt;GodlyUser&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
</description>
